      def: 'Rupture of the tunica albuginea of a corpus cavernosum in the erect penis, almost always from forced bending during intercourse. It may involve the urethra, especially if bilateral.',
      mech: 'The albuginea, very thin during erection, tears: blood escapes from the corpora ("aubergine" haematoma). Without repair, fibrosis, curvature and erectile dysfunction follow.',
